#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:4
msgid "继续执行"
msgstr "Continue execution"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:9
msgid "继续执行节点是一个 **灵活的条件判断节点**，用于有条件地控制工作流分支的执行，根据指定的条件判断是否继续执行后续步骤。"
msgstr ""
"The continue execution node is a **flexible conditional judgment node**, "
"used to conditionally control the execution of workflow branches and "
"determine whether to continue executing subsequent steps based on specified "
"conditions."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:11
msgid "该节点的核心特点是 **根据输入元素类型自动适配配置选项**："
msgstr ""
"The core feature of this node is **automatic adaptation of configuration "
"options based on input element type**:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:13
msgid "当输入来自 **属性定义节点** 时，提供数值、字符串、布尔等基础类型的比较"
msgstr ""
"When input comes from **Property Definition Node**, comparison of basic "
"types such as numeric values, strings, and Boolean is provided."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:14
msgid "当输入来自 **检测类节点** (如模型、检测过滤、区域内时间等)时，额外提供检测数量、类别、置信度等专用比较"
msgstr ""
"When the input comes from **detection class nodes** (such as model, "
"detection filtering, time in area, etc.), additional dedicated comparisons "
"such as detection number, category, confidence, etc. are provided"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:15
msgid "当输入来自 **可视化节点** 时，提供图像属性（高度、宽度、宽高比）的比较"
msgstr ""
"Provides comparison of image properties (height, width, aspect ratio) when "
"input comes from **Visualization Node**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:17
msgid "该节点支持多种比较模式（静态模式、动态模式），可以灵活地根据工作流中的数据状态来控制执行流程，是实现条件分支逻辑的核心节点。"
msgstr ""
"This node supports multiple comparison modes (static mode, dynamic mode) and"
" can flexibly control the execution process based on the data status in the "
"workflow. It is the core node for implementing conditional branch logic."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:20
msgid "输入 / 输出"
msgstr "input/output"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:22
msgid "**输入**："
msgstr "**enter**:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:24
msgid "任意数据元素（来自上游节点的输出）"
msgstr "Arbitrary data element (output from upstream node)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:25
msgid "条件判断参数"
msgstr "Conditional judgment parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:27
msgid "**输出**："
msgstr "**Output**:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:29
msgid "当条件为真时：继续执行后续步骤"
msgstr "When the condition is true: continue with the next steps"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:30
msgid "当条件为假时：阻止该分支继续执行"
msgstr ""
"When the condition is false: prevent the branch from continuing execution"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:33
msgid "配置参数概览"
msgstr "Configuration parameters overview"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:39
msgid "参数名称"
msgstr "Parameter name"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:40
msgid "说明"
msgstr "illustrate"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:41
msgid "示例/默认值"
msgstr "Example/Default"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:42
msgid "**节点名称**"
msgstr "**Node name**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:43
msgid "步骤名称，用于标识该节点的唯一标识符"
msgstr "Step name, a unique identifier used to identify this node"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:44
msgid "``continue_if_1``"
msgstr "``continue_if_1``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:45
msgid "**备注**"
msgstr "**Remark**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:46
msgid "可选的备注信息，用于描述该步骤的用途"
msgstr "Optional remarks describing the purpose of this step"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:47
msgid "留空"
msgstr "Leave blank"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:48
msgid "**条件语句**"
msgstr "**Conditional statement**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:49
msgid "点击进入配置页面，设置条件判断的详细参数"
msgstr ""
"Click to enter the configuration page and set the detailed parameters for "
"conditional judgment."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:50
msgid "点击配置"
msgstr "Click configure"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:51
msgid "**下一步**"
msgstr "**Next step**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:52
msgid "当条件为真时执行的下一个步骤"
msgstr "The next step to execute when the condition is true"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:53
msgid "从下拉菜单选择"
msgstr "Select from drop-down menu"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:56
msgid "条件语句配置说明"
msgstr "Conditional statement configuration instructions"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:58
msgid "点击 **条件语句** 进入配置页面后，需要设置以下参数："
msgstr ""
"After clicking **Conditional Statement** to enter the configuration page, "
"you need to set the following parameters:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:60
msgid "**选择一个元素**：选择用于条件判断的数据源（上游节点的输出）"
msgstr ""
"**Select an element**: Select the data source for conditional judgment "
"(output of the upstream node)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:61
msgid "**条件基于**：根据选择的元素类型，系统会自动提供相应的比较选项"
msgstr ""
"**Condition based**: Based on the selected element type, the system will "
"automatically provide corresponding comparison options"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:62
msgid "**在计数之前过滤检测结果** (可选)：某些元素类型下可用，用于先过滤再判断"
msgstr ""
"**Filter detection results before counting** (optional): Available for "
"certain element types, used to filter first and then judge."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:63
msgid "**设置检测阈值**：选择比较操作符和输入比较值"
msgstr ""
"**Set detection threshold**: Select comparison operator and enter comparison"
" value"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:66
msgid "**关键特性**：该节点会根据\"选择一个元素\"的类型，自动在\"条件基于\"中提供不同的选项。这使得节点可以适配不同场景的需求。"
msgstr ""
"**Key Features**: This node will automatically provide different options in "
"\"Condition based on\" depending on the type of \"Select an element\".This "
"allows the node to adapt to the needs of different scenarios."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:105
msgid "下一步配置"
msgstr "Next configuration"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/continue_if.rst:107
msgid "**下一步** 参数用于指定当条件为真时要执行的后续节点"
msgstr ""
"The **Next** parameter is used to specify the subsequent nodes to be "
"executed when the condition is true."
